{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EugHYuAWTyVgzMxUa5gJmq","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 schema-dag-extraction 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (42 个)\\n\\n- **bootstrap_ci_analysis**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp016_fewrel_error_taxonomy**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp012_llama_fewnerd_r2**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **exp012_llama_fewnerd**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **exp007_error_taxonomy**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_fewrel_formal_80rel**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_fewrel_formal**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp008_sdgd_zero_fewnerd_r2**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp008_sdgd_zero_fewnerd**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **fewrel_pilot**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp004_maven_bcs**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp002_confusability_controlled**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp003a_prompt_v2_rerun**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-004**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp001_count_baseline**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-16\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n（无）\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- exp017_gpt4o_mini_fewrel（准备中）\\n- exp_cross_embedding_sensitivity（准备中）\\n- exp_fewrel_v2_n25（准备中）\\n- bcs_max_to_mean_fix（准备中）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **exp_confusability_batch_composition** (success): Confusability-aware batch composition (graph coloring on SCS matrix to separate high-SCS pairs) improves per-type accuracy and reduces substitution errors compared to random batching and single-pass full schema, providing a practical application of the confusability findings.\\n- **exp_fewrel_16rel_bootstrap** (success): FewRel 16-type pool, 100 random 8-type batches, bootstrap CI for BCS effect (Δ_BCS). 填 tab:bcs_controlled 16-rel 行的 CI，并与 80-rel 计算 amplification ratio 正式 CI。D033 已批准。 ← 基于 exp_fewrel_formal\\n- **exp_docred_confusability** (success): Schema-induced degradation (count + confusability channels) generalizes to document-level RE (DocRED, 96 relation types), strengthening cross-dataset evidence for Claims 1 and 2. ← 基于 exp_fewrel_formal_8