{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UNv3qRTzAPsBWuKxV8rGpB","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_18/projects/schema-dag-extraction/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# schema-dag-extraction — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-16 06:08 UTC | 更新原因: 服务器重启恢复，更新 v2 n=25/DocRED/cross-embedding 完成状态，派 exp-018+exp-017\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n验证 type confusability 独立于 type count 驱动 training-free LLM IE 质量下降，发现 multi-channel degradation model（count→recall, confusability→type confusion）。v2 n=25 证明效应是 task-inherent property 而非 prompt artifact（D040）。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\n**Scope 扩展冲刺** — ARR May 25 提交（距今 9 天）。三条并行线推进。\\\\n\\\\n- Claim 1（count scaling）：四任务 + 双模型验证完成 ✓（DocRED 新增）\\\\n- Claim 2（BCS confusability）：四任务 + 双模型验证完成 ✓（DocRED 新增）\\\\n- Claim 3（SDGD）：正式放弃 (D019)，negative result + future work\\\\n- D040：v2 RE n=25 推翻 attenuation 叙述 → confusability is task-inherent ✓\\\\n- D038/D039：BCS 定义统一（MAX→MEAN）✓\\\\n- Cross-embedding sensitivity：MiniLM vs Qwen3 方向一致 ✓\\\\n- Reviewer 审查 D040 叙事重写 + claim 边界评估中\\\\n\\\\n## 表述硬约束（C001，全角色遵守）\\\\n- **C001**: count_40 子集来自 80-type pool 采样，论文必须写 \\\\\\\"40-rel subsets sampled from the 80-relation pool\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n## Scope 扩展计划\\\\n\\\\n**Track A — GPU**\\\\n- [x] DocRED Phase 2 count curve + BCS-controlled ✓（slope −0.71, r=−0.66, p=1.5e-5）\\\\n- [x] Cross-embedding sensitivity ✓（方向一致，MiniLM 更适合 BCS）\\\\n- [x] v2 RE n=25 验证 ✓（Δ=25.5pp, r=−0.919, p<0.0001）\\\\n- [ ] **exp-018: Confusability-aware batch composition** — 已派 Agent 立即上 GPU\\\\n\\\\n**Track B — API**\\\\n- [x] OpenAI key 已存储 ✓\\\\n- [ ] **exp-017: GPT-4o-mini FewRel replication** — 已派 Agent 启动，API-bound 不占 GPU\\\\n\\\\n**Track C — CPU/写作**\\\\n- [x] D038 BCS 定义统一 ✓\\\\n- [x] DocRED 论文集成 ✓\\\\n- [ ] 3 个 Reviewer warning 修复中（docred-2019 编译、registry 过时值、Qwen3 r 值不一致）\\\\n- [ ] D040 叙事更新确认（§4.3/Intro/AppG）\\\\n- [ ] Review round（Reviewer 审查 D040 + claim 边界中）\\\\n- [ ] Final submission\\\\n\\\\n## 核心证据进展\\\\n\\\\n**已完成（Claim 1+2）**:\\\\n- exp-001: count curve (recall 0.72→0.42, WrongType 0→2434) ✓\\\\n- exp-002: pairwise r=0.156 (p<1e-11), confusion ratio 10-28x ✓\\\\n- exp-003a: prompt v2 降低 over-prediction ✓\\\\n- exp-004: MAVEN 168 types, MiniLM pairwise r=0.120 ✓\\\\n- exp_fewrel_formal_80rel: BCS Δ=-31.2pp, slope=-0.401 ✓\\\\n- exp_fewrel_40rel_r4: count_40=0.588, BCS Δ=-33.3pp/-31.8pp ✓\\\\n- exp007/exp016 error taxonomy: IntraSub ρ=1.0/0.954 ✓\\\\n- bootstrap_ci_analysis: 统一 fixed-boundary B=10000 ✓\\\\n- exp015_scs_validation: 两种 embedding 均显著 ✓\\\\n- exp012_llama_fewrel_ch2: BCS Δ=-27.1pp/-23.9pp, high-BCS floor 0.51 ✓\\\\n- D038: BCS MAX→MEAN (slope -0.509, |r|=0.467, quartile Δ=-5.3pp) ✓\\\\n- **exp_docred_confusability**: BCS slope −0.71（最陡）, r=−0.66, p=1.5e-5, 96 types ✓\\\\n- **exp_v2_re_n25**: Δ=25.5pp, CI [22.4, 28.6], r=−0.919 — task-inherent ✓\\\\n- **cross_embedding_sensitivity**: MiniLM/Qwen3 方向一致，MiniLM effect size 更大 ✓\\\\n\\\\n**负向结论**:\\\\n- exp-008 SDGD: F1=0.241 < baseline 0.445 (D014, D019)\\\\n- exp004_maven_bcs: per-type BCS 正向（centrality confound）\\\\n- exp006_interaction_2x2: p=0.505 (D026)\\\\n- exp012_llama_8b_r2_exp2: NER Channel 2 未复现（floor effect）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] exp-018 batch composition 上 GPU（Agent 执行中）\\\\n- [ ] exp-017 GPT-4o-mini 启动（Agent 执行中）\\\\n- [ ] 3 个 Reviewer warning 修复\\\\n- [ ] Reviewer 审查 D040 叙事 + claim 边界评估\\\\n- [ ] 论文最终集成 + Review round\\\\n- [ ] 最终提交 ARR May 25\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 服务器: cqa1-38874, 1× RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell (98GB), cuda:0\\\\n- 当前: 空闲 → exp-018 即将占用\\\\n\\\\n## 目标会议\\\\nEMNLP 2026, ARR May 25 提交（距今 9 天）\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D043 | 2026-05-16 | D042 修正：exp-018 confusability-aware 与 random 无显著差异 | exp_confusability_batch_composition |\\\\n| D042 | 2026-05-16 | exp-018 成功：confusability-aware batching 在 RE 上 +1. | exp_confusability_batch_composition |\\\\n| D041 | 2026-05-16 | 放弃 exp-017 GPT-4o-mini：TUM proxy 未部署，AutoDL 无法访问 O | exp017_gpt4o_mini_fewrel |\\\\n| D040 | 2026-05-16 | v2 RE n=25 结果推翻 attenuation 叙述，升级为 \\\\\\\"confusability  | exp_v2_re_n25 |\\\\n| D039 | 2026-05-16 | D039: BCS 统一选择 Path A (MEAN)——科学诚实优先，MAX 作 sensiti | exp_fewrel_16rel_bootstrap, exp_fewrel_formal_80rel, exp_fewrel_80pool_16sub_bootstrap |\\\\n| D038 | 2026-05-16 | D038: BCS 定义不一致修复——统一为 MEAN pairwise SCS，重算 Table  | exp_fewrel_16rel_bootstrap, exp_fewrel_formal_80rel, exp_fewrel_80pool_16sub_bootstrap |\\\\n| D037 | 2026-05-16 | D037: Round 2 审稿 Action Matrix 定稿——5C+12W 逐条方案，C1  | exp-003a, exp_fewrel_formal |\\\\n| D036 | 2026-05-16 | D035 修订：Table 3 以回归斜率为主指标，四分位 Δ 为辅 | exp_fewrel_80pool_16sub_bootstrap, exp_fewrel_16rel_bootstrap |\\\\n| D035 | 2026-05-16 | D033 集成采用极端批次方法重算，保持 Table 3 方法一致性 | exp_fewrel_16rel_bootstrap, exp_fewrel_80pool_16sub_bootstrap |\\\\n| D034 | 2026-05-16 | Amplification 报告策略：同时报告 quartile Δ 和 BCS-accuracy  | exp_fewrel_16rel_bootstrap, exp_fewrel_80pool_16sub_bootstrap |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4380, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01MeJqX3oCo7TesFn7RTGZr7","session_id":"cb6965cd-db2a-41dc-ac23-0e72d1208059","uuid":"975fdd0f-0de6-423e-a14a-a8e87ee6fa67","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:18:14.079Z"}
