-16%\\\\\\\"在 NER 端不成立，需限定为仅\\\\n    RE。NER/RE 差异本身是有意义的发现，可加强分析深度。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp007_error_taxonomy\\\\n    role: source\\\\n    result: NER missed rates 42.8/64.8/49.9% (recomputed)\\\\n  - exp_id: exp016_fewrel_error_taxonomy\\\\n    role: source\\\\n    result: RE missed rates 10.4/11.3/13.1/15.7% (registry verified)\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D026\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 18:36 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp006 交互效应不显著(p=0.505)，结论 negative；不在论文主体引用，至多作为 supplementary exploratory\\\\n    analysis\\\\n  rationale: 2×2 factorial 设计（count × BCS）的交互项 z=-0.667, p=0.505, estimate=-0.036，完全在噪声范围内。此外设计存在结构性混淆：BCS\\\\n    与 count 不正交（high count 的 BCS floor 被推高），high_count/high_bcs 的 10 个 batch BCS 完全相同（伪重复）。Reviewer\\\\n    建议禁止声称 multiplicative interaction。实验为 P1（D017 降优），paper story 不依赖此结果。资源转向 exp012（P0\\\\n    多模型验证）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006_interaction_2x2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 'negative: interaction z=-0.667, p=0.505, not significant'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D027\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 20:01 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp012 exp1 跨模型验证成功：Channel 1 (count→recall) 在 LLaMA-3.1-8B 上复现，per-batch\\\\n    r=0.725\\\\n  rationale: LLaMA-3.1-8B recall 从 0.702 降至 0.273（-43pp），Qwen3-32B 从 0.640 降至 0.304（-34pp）。Per-batch\\\\n    correlation r=0.725 表明 schema 配置是困难的主要来源而非模型特异性。弱模型下降更陡，支持 schema complexity as\\\\n    task-inherent difficulty 叙事。exp1 数据已交 Paper Agent 写入论文。exp2（Channel 2 BCS-controlled）正在重跑。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp012_llama_8b_r2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 'exp1 success: recall decline -43pp, per-batch r=0.725 with Qwen3-32B'\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D028\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 20:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp012 exp2 Channel 2 跨模型复现失败：极端 batch 方向正确但效果微弱(5pp/4.3pp)，随机 batch 信号淹没在\\\\n    noise 中。论文不引用 exp2 数据，保持 Limitations 中\\\\\\\"Channel 2 pending\\\\\\\"的保守表述\\\\n  rationale: LLaMA-3.1-8B 上 BCS-controlled 效应远弱于 Qwen3-32B（Δ5pp vs 31.2pp），count_12\\\\n    的 BCS 分布压缩严重（Δ0.030），多个随机 batch 出现反向趋势（高 BCS 反而高 F1）。per_type_f1 全为 0（缺 char offset），无法做\\\\n    error taxonomy 分析。floor effect + BCS 压缩 + 模型能力不足共同导致信号不可检测。当前论文 Limitations 只\\\\n    claim Channel 1 replicated，这是最安全的策略。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp012_llama_8b_r2_exp2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 'Channel 2 not replicated: extreme Δ=5pp/4.3pp, random batches noisy with\\\\n      counter-examples'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D027\\\\n- id: D029\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 21:12 UTC\\\\n  summary: 提分策略：(1) 40-rel 中间点已启动；(2) LLaMA-8B FewRel Channel 2 作为第二实验；(3) \\\\\\\"pending\\\\\\\"改诚实报告；目标\\\\n    7→8+\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 独立评估：40-rel 提分 +0.5-0.75（3点scaling curve），LLaMA FewRel Channel\\\\n    2 提分 +0.75 if positive / +0.25 if negative（FewRel 效应大、metric 无 span 噪声，比 NER 更可能检测到跨模型信号）。\\\\\\\"pending\\\\\\\"\\\\n    改诚实报告避免信任风险（-0.5 vs -1.5）。最乐观 8.0-8.5，最可能 7.5-8.0。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_fewrel_40rel_r4\\\\n    role: planned\\\\n    result: PREPARING\\\\n  - exp_id: exp012_llama_fewrel\\\\n    role: planned\\\\n    result: not yet created\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D027\\\\n  - D028\\\\n- id: D030\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 22:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp012 两种场景预案：正向升级 cross-family claim（有限度），负向 frame 为 capacity-dependent\\\\n    finding；两种场景都诚实报告，不追加新模型\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 预判分析：场景 A 诚实报告 7.5-8.0 分，场景 B 诚实报告 7.0-7.5 分，隐藏则 6.0-6.5。不追加模型因\\\\n    DDL 10 天内边际收益递减。3 tasks × 1 model 的任务多样性论点比 cross-model 更强。Claim 安全边界受 C001（40-rel\\\\n    来自 80-pool）和 C002（BCS amplification 仅 2 schema sizes）约束。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp012_llama_fewrel_ch2\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D022\\\\n- id: D031\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 22:40 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp012 强复现（场景 A），执行 claim 升级 + 新发现\\\\\\\"model-invariant high-BCS floor\\\\\\\"加入正文\\\\n  rationale: LLaMA-8B BCS effect -27.1pp/-23.9pp 远超强复现阈值(15pp)，达 Qwen3 的 75-87%。高\\\\n    BCS 准确率跨模型恒定(0.510 vs 0.510)是预案外的新发现，表明 confusability 是 task-inherent difficulty\\\\n    而非 model-specific。Reviewer 评估提分至 7.75-8.25。按 D030 场景 A 预案执行 patch。NER negative\\\\n    由 metric/floor effect 解释，诚实报告。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp012_llama_fewrel_ch2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'strong_positive: BCS Δ=-27.1pp(count_8)/-23.9pp(count_16), high-BCS floor\\\\n      model-invariant at 0.51'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D030\\\\n  - D022\\\\n- id: D032\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 22:41 UTC\\\\n  summary: 激活场景 A：Channel 2 跨模型复现成功，升级 claim 表述，不追加新模型，聚焦写作\\\\n  rationale: exp012 LLaMA-8B FewRel Δ=-27.1pp/-23.9pp，强复现。高 BCS floor 跨模型恒定(~0.51)是新发现。Reviewer\\\\n    预估 7.75-8.25。DDL 10 天内不追加模型，边际收益递减且风险高。Paper Agent 执行 Scene A patch。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp012_llama_fewrel_ch2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'success: Δ=-27.1pp(count_8), -23.9pp(count_16), high-BCS floor model-invariant\\\\n      ~0.51'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D030\\\\n  - D022\\\\n- id: D033\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 00:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: 追加 16-rel 100 random batches + bootstrap CI 实验，填补 tab:bcs_controlled 空白\\\\n    + amplification ratio 正式 CI\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 评估 Soundness 3→4 最高 ROI 方案：1-2 GPU 小时，消除表格 \\\\\\\"---\\\\\\\" 空白，让 3.4× amplification\\\\n    获得双端 CI 支撑。90% 概率正面结果。方案 2（FewRel pairwise）和方案 3（额外 seed）ROI 不足跳过。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_fewrel_formal\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: 16-rel 单 batch Δ=9.1pp 无 CI\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D031\\\\n- id: D034\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 01:55 UTC\\\\n  summary: Amplification 报告策略：同时报告 quartile Δ 和 BCS-accuracy 回归斜率，用斜率比较作为公平的 amplification\\\\n    证据（消除 BCS 域不重叠问题）\\\\n  rationale: D033 结果 Δ=-7.42pp（quartile）vs 原 -9.1pp（extreme batch），方法论不对称导致 ratio\\\\n    从 3.4× 变 4.2×。Reviewer 指出 80-pool-within BCS 范围 [0.47,0.65] 与 16-rel [0.65,0.90]\\\\n    几乎不重叠，Q4-Q1 Δ 不直接可比。斜率比较是标准化后的公平指标：如果斜率随 pool size 增大，则 amplification 成立且不受 BCS\\\\n    域差异影响。论文将报告两种指标（Δ + slope），以 slope 为主要 amplification 证据。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_fewrel_16rel_bootstrap\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: Δ=-7.42pp CI[-9.45,-4.49], r=-0.6373\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_fewrel_80pool_16sub_bootstrap\\\\n    role: pending\\\\n    result: PREPARING\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D033\\\\n- id: D035\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 01:58 UTC\\\\n  summary: D033 集成采用极端批次方法重算，保持 Table 3 方法一致性\\\\n  rationale: D033 bootstrap_ci.json 的 amplification 4.2× 混用了极端批次(80-rel分子)和四分位(16-rel分母)两种方法。论文\\\\n    Table 3 统一用极端批次比较，因此需用 D033 的 100 batch 数据按极端批次方法重算 16-rel Δ 和 CI。四分位 CI 作补充证据放正文，展示跨分析粒度稳健性。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_fewrel_16rel_bootstrap\\\\n    role: source_data\\\\n    result: success, Δ_quartile=7.42pp\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_fewrel_80pool_16sub_bootstrap\\\\n    role: pending_comparison\\\\n    result: allocated_not_started\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D036\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 02:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: D035 修订：Table 3 以回归斜率为主指标，四分位 Δ 为辅\\\\n  rationale: 80-pool 四分位 Δ=-3.92pp CI 跨零（[-7.79, +0.42]），但回归斜率=-0.401 CI 排除零（[-0.684,\\\\n    -0.062]）。两组斜率可比（-0.449 vs -0.401），说明 per-unit-BCS 效应一致。原 D035 计划用极端批次 Δ 做 Table\\\\n    3 主指标，但数据表明斜率是更稳健的指标。BCS range 差异（16-rel [0.65,0.90] vs 80-pool [0.46,0.68]）解释了四分位对比的弱化——80-pool\\\\n    类型多样性压缩了 BCS 对比空间。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_fewrel_80pool_16sub_bootstrap\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: slope=-0.401 significant, quartile CI crosses zero\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_fewrel_16rel_bootstrap\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: slope=-0.449, quartile significant\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D035\\\\n- id: D037\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 03:13 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D037: Round 2 审稿 Action Matrix 定稿——5C+12W 逐条方案，C1 需 v2 BCS-controlled\\\\n    RE 实验'\\\\n  rationale: Round 2 borderline (3.0/5)。Reviewer 独立审查确认：(1) C1 prompt 混淆是唯一可能推翻核心贡献的项，仅公开\\\\n    prompt 不够，需 v2 RE BCS-controlled 子集验证；(2) C2/C3 通过 D036 slope 叙事已部分解决，需清除 Abstract\\\\n    残留的 9.1pp vs 31.2pp 直接对比；(3) C4/C5 是 desk-reject 风险必须首先解决；(4) W3 cluster bootstrap\\\\n    是 CPU 工作可并行；(5) W5 SDGD on RE 优先级低于 C1。执行计划：Day 1 C5+C4+C1(prompt+实验)+W3+W4，Day\\\\n    2-3 编辑工作，Day 4-5 W5 if time。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-003a\\\\n    role: v1/v2 comparison baseline\\\\n    result: v2 有 count curve 和 within-count 数据但无 BCS-controlled RE\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_fewrel_formal\\\\n    role: core RE evidence\\\\n    result: v2 prompt, BCS Δ=-31.2pp\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D036\\\\n- id: D038\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 04:35 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D038: BCS 定义不一致修复——统一为 MEAN pairwise SCS，重算 Table 4 + permutation test'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 compute_bcs.py 用 MAX pairwise SCS，而论文定义和 80-pool 实验用 MEAN。16-rel\\\\n    bootstrap 和 80-rel formal 的 BCS 在错误 scale 上，导致 permutation test（p=0.436）混合了不同度量的斜率。方向性结论不变（斜率均为负），但精确数值和\\\\n    p 值需重算。修复为纯 CPU 工作（从现有 SCS matrix 重算），不需要重跑 GPU 实验。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_fewrel_16rel_bootstrap\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: BCS 用了 MAX，需重算为 MEAN\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_fewrel_formal_80rel\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: BCS 用了 MAX，需重算为 MEAN\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_fewrel_80pool_16sub_bootstrap\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: 已用 MEAN，无需修改\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D036\\\\n  - D037\\\\n- id: D039\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 04:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D039: BCS 统一选择 Path A (MEAN)——科学诚实优先，MAX 作 sensitivity analysis 报告'\\\\n  rationale: Path A (MEAN BCS) vs Path B (MAX BCS)：选择 MEAN 因为 (1) 论文公式原本就定义 MEAN，改\\\\n    MAX 有 metric shopping 嫌疑；(2) 核心结论不变——r=-0.467 仍 p<1e-6，Δ=-5.3pp CI 排除零；(3) permutation\\\\n    p=0.60 反而比旧 0.44 更支持 slope consistency claim；(4) 80-rel 斜率翻正是 BCS range 太窄 (IQR=0.033)\\\\n    导致的噪声，注明即可。MAX BCS 可在 appendix 作 sensitivity analysis 报告。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_fewrel_16rel_bootstrap\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: 'r: -0.637→-0.467, Δ: -7.4pp→-5.3pp'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_fewrel_formal_80rel\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: slope 翻正(+0.221 n.s.), BCS range=0.089 太窄\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_fewrel_80pool_16sub_bootstrap\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: 已是 MEAN, 无变化\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D038\\\\n- id: D040\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 05:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: v2 RE n=25 结果推翻 attenuation 叙述，升级为 \\\\\\\"confusability is task-inherent, not\\\\n    prompt artifact\\\\\\\"\\\\n  rationale: v2 prompt n=25 实验显示 Δ=25.5pp (CI [22.4,28.6], p<0.0001, r=−0.919)，效应巨大且高度显著。此前\\\\n    n=5 不显著是 underpowered + narrow BCS contrast (0.21 vs 0.44) 导致的伪阴性。v2 不消除效应意味着\\\\n    confusability 是 task-inherent property，直接回应 \\\\\\\"prompt artifact\\\\\\\" reviewer concern。论文\\\\n    §4.3、Introduction、Appendix G 均需更新，paper_framing.md 的 prompt sensitivity concern\\\\n    从 partially addressed 升级为 addressed。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_v2_re_n25\\\\n    role: primary evidence\\\\n    result: Δ=25.5pp, r=−0.919, p<0.0001\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D041\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 06:58 UTC\\\\n  summary: 放弃 exp-017 GPT-4o-mini：TUM proxy 未部署，AutoDL 无法访问 OpenAI API，不值得搭建基础设施\\\\n  rationale: AutoDL 服务器无法直接访问 OpenAI API（TUM proxy service not deployed）。距 DDL 9 天，debug\\\\n    基础设施的 ROI 太低。当前 2 模型族 (Qwen3-32B + LLaMA-3.1-8B) 满足跨模型验证基本要求，Discussion 已有 model\\\\n    coverage limitation 表述。exp-018 batch composition 的 practical contribution 优先级更高。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp017_gpt4o_mini_fewrel\\\\n    role: cancelled\\\\n    result: 'BLOCKED: TUM proxy not deployed'\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D042\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 07:38 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp-018 成功：confusability-aware batching 在 RE 上 +1.44pp (显著)，无 merge amplification。进入论文收尾阶段。\\\\n  rationale: Graph coloring BCS 最小化分组 accuracy 0.8021 > random 0.7877±0.0178 (超 95%\\\\n    CI 上界 0.7967)，single_pass 0.5042 验证 schema overload。RE closed-set 无 merge amplification，与\\\\n    NER SDGD 失败形成对比。论文从纯诊断升级为诊断+缓解，直接回应 W6 (§5 过短) 和 SDGD 缺 actionable takeaway 的审稿意见。距\\\\n    DDL 9 天，核心实验已全部完成，进入写作集成 + final review。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_confusability_batch_composition\\\\n    role: primary evidence\\\\n    result: aware=0.8021 > random=0.7877, single_pass=0.5042\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D043\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 07:44 UTC\\\\n  summary: D042 修正：exp-018 confusability-aware 与 random 无显著差异 (p≈0.22)，oracle routing\\\\n    使 \\\\\\\"无 merge\\\\\\\" 为空真。§5 写法降级。\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer critical 审查发现：(1) 统计检验错误——单点 vs mean CI 不是合法检验，排名法 p≈0.19，z\\\\n    检验 p=0.22；(2) 实验用 oracle routing（每个样本只路由到含 gold type 的 batch），根本没有 merge 步骤，\\\\\\\"无\\\\n    merge amplification\\\\\\\"是空真。+29.8pp 是纯 count 效应（80→10 types），confusability-aware 额外收益\\\\n    +1.44pp 不显著。§5 写法从\\\\\\\"诊断+缓解\\\\\\\"降级为\\\\\\\"RE oracle routing decomposition 有效（count 效应）+ confusability-aware\\\\n    方向一致但不显著\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_confusability_batch_composition\\\\n    role: re-evaluated\\\\n    result: aware vs random p≈0.22 n.s.; oracle routing, no actual merge\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D042\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 27674, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01MeJqX3oCo7TesFn7RTGZr7","session_id":"cb6965cd-db2a-41dc-ac23-0e72d1208059","uuid":"91d45bbd-728d-43f5-b12e-1623bde9f799","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:18:39.956Z"}
